# Quartz frontend. The version pin (package.json) and the override (brain-site.yaml) are
# tracked. The generated tree is NOT listed here on purpose: it is registered in
# .git/info/exclude by `npx brain-site setup`, because Quartz's Static emitter globs with
# gitignore:true and a .gitignore entry would make every static asset invisible to the
# build. See docs/meta/2026-08-10-brain-site-extraction-design.md §2.6 in the
# eque2-chalkstring-brain repo for the full reasoning.
